/--
Thesis source:
`1 - theoretical foundations/3_market_actions.tex`, subsection
"Analytical Results for Primitive Actions".

Original label: hypothesis used by `cor:sorted-operations-measurable`.

Informal statement: a sorting rule is measurable when its map from tuple space
to sorted tuple space is Borel measurable for the thesis extended-metric
topologies.

Lean strategy / thesis relation note: the thesis' later `thm:measurable-sorting-exists` supplies
such sorting rules; in this project that theorem is proved in
